{"version":1,"content":"<p>「《GTA6》發售！公司不批假，我就辭職！」據説，有人甚至在向公司提交的休假申請中，直接寫下了這樣一句話。11月19日（周四），《俠盜獵車手6》（GTA6）正式發售。這款開放世界遊戲是人氣系列時隔約13年推出的全新作品。玩家可以駕駛汽車在城市中自由穿梭、實施搶劫、躲避警察追捕，幾乎可以隨心所欲地做任何事情。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587060.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:44:08.564257+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:22:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:37:19.272264+00:00","content_hash":"a45a70c3c31553fb52eb45e28d137b5db24859f0a5b6f9027a5ed3f2e305dd9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}